    "primary": {
     "type": "TextChapter",
     "page_section_element_title": [],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Date Input is typically used as a Form element. It provides the flexibility of both manual entry for users familiar with the format and a calendar view for those who prefer selecting dates visually. However, Date Input is less suited for mobile devices, as the on-screen keyboard can take up significant space and obstruct the calendar when the text field is focused. In such cases, it's better to use a Date Picker Modal to provide a more optimised, full-screen date selection experience.",
